{"role": "assistant", "content": "I can't confirm the card is safe. I have no tool that shows card status or security events, so I can't tell whether the card has been compromised. A duplicate charge doesn't by itself mean your card details were misused.

From our security policy, you can block the card yourself at any time. The block takes effect immediately and can be reversed within 30 days. After 30 days, a replacement card would need to be ordered. I can't place the block with my tools, so you'd need to do it through the Verta app or another channel.

If you think someone else is using your card, block it first, then tell me and I can escalate to a human agent. Would you like me to do that?"}
